"possède pas un partitionnement suffisant nous vous recommandons de le "
"réaliser."
msgstr ""
"Most of the data is stored in ``/var``. A daily backup is performed in "
"``/var/backup```. If the image used does not have sufficient "
"partitioning, we recommend that you do it."

